 cbits←pic ReadBMP filename;bmp;name
 ⍝ Extract pixel array from a .BMP file

 bmp←⎕VGET name←(##.##.Next pic._Owner)##.##.∆WC'BitMap'('File'filename) ⍝ Create an ephemeral Bitmap object
 cbits←bmp ##.##.∆WG'CBits' ⍝ Capture the pixels directly
 ##.##.∆EX name ⍝ Destroy our Bitmap - we don't need it any more
